INSERT INTO `email_templates` VALUES (43,'Moni template','<p>Moni email template</p>',1,69,NULL,'2024-10-30 23:44:21','2024-10-30 23:44:21'),(44,'Kashfi template','<p>Kashfi email template</p>',1,67,1,'2024-10-30 23:46:49','2024-10-31 06:38:37'),(45,'create agents templete','<p><strong>The Need for Speed:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<ul><li> The first reason to use a sanity check is for speed. Nobody would refuse some buffer time to fix the <a href=\"https://testgrid.io/blog/bug-finding-ways-in-software/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"post\" data-id=\"5932\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">discovered bugs</a>.\r\n However, this testing is limited in scope and has clearly defined \r\nexamination areas. This testing can be done intuitively without a \r\nspecific test case.</li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><strong>No Extra Effort Is Necessary:</strong> </p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Second, the sanity check keeps you from doing anything you don’t \r\nneed to. It indicates whether additional tests should be performed. This\r\n eliminates extra work but gives the test team more time and simplifies \r\nthe process by eliminating formal bug reporting.</li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Identifying Outward Issues:</strong> </p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<ul><li>A sanity check reveals deployment issues. For example, the tester \r\nmight encounter an inaccurate user interface if the developers did not \r\ninclude all the resource files in the compilation. </li><li>Furthermore, developers may fail to specify some critical features \r\nto make them visible to testers. A sanity check detects such issues and \r\nprovides a quick solution for a stable release.</li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Quick Responses:</strong> </p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<ul><li>Finally, a test quickly defines the product’s status and predicts \r\nthe next steps. In the event of a failure, you can direct your test team\r\n to resolve the issues discovered before the product release before \r\nmoving on to the next task. </li><li>Simultaneously, if you pass this test, you can ask your team to move\r\n on to the next task, involving only one developer or tester in the \r\nmodifications and fixes, or you can set aside some time to correct the \r\nerrors.</li></ul>',1,75,1,'2024-11-05 08:32:15','2024-12-29 05:49:56'),(46,'second agent created email','<p>It aids in the rapid identification of issues in the core \r\nfunctionality. As a result, the application’s stability can be validated\r\n quickly, and any problems can be reported and fixed quickly.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Because no documentation is required, these tests can be completed less than other formal tests.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>If problems are discovered during Sanity testing, then the build is \r\nrejected. This saves a significant amount of time and resources that \r\nwould otherwise be used to run regression tests.</p><p>It aids in the rapid identification of issues in the core \r\nfunctionality. As a result, the application’s stability can be validated\r\n quickly, and any problems can be reported and fixed quickly.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>Because no documentation is required, these tests can be completed less than other formal tests.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>If problems are discovered during Sanity testing, then the build is \r\nrejected. This saves a significant amount of time and resources that \r\nwould otherwise be used to run regression tests.</p><p></p><p></p>',0,69,1,'2024-11-05 09:30:22','2024-11-17 09:39:03'),(52,'Meet the new Customer Support Representative','<p>Hi xyz,<br><br>\r\n\r\nFollowing up on my previous email about the collaboration with your \r\nwebsite. I’m still interested in writing a guest post about the best UX \r\npractices for dating apps. With 10 years of experience in the mobile \r\nindustry, I have a lot of insights to share with your audience.<br><br>\r\n\r\nPlease let me know if you’re interested in collaborating!<br><br>\r\n\r\nBest,<br>\r\n<span>xyz<br></span></p>',1,1,NULL,'2025-01-15 05:16:14','2025-01-15 05:16:14'),(53,'Project Proposal','<p data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1092\"><strong data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1092\">Dear Mr. Rahman,</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1119\">I hope you’re doing well.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1356\">I wanted to follow up regarding the integration proposal for the Social Magnet platform that we shared last week. We’ve outlined the technical and budgetary considerations, and we\'re ready to move forward once we receive your feedback.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1386\"><strong data-start=\"1358\" data-end=\"1386\">Key Proposal Highlights:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1520\"><li data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1452\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1452\">Seamless integration with existing invoice and report modules</p>\r\n</li><li data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1484\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1484\">Estimated timeline: 2 weeks</p>\r\n</li><li data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1520\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1520\">Initial cost estimate: BDT 75,000</p>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1522\" data-end=\"1616\">Please let us know your thoughts or if you’d like to arrange a call for further clarification.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1618\" data-end=\"1760\">Best regards,<br data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1634\"><strong>xyz</strong><br data-start=\"1651\" data-end=\"1654\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1654\" data-end=\"1678\">Software Engineer</strong><br data-start=\"1678\" data-end=\"1681\">\r\n<strong data-start=\"1681\" data-end=\"1706\">XYZ Technologies Ltd.</strong><br data-start=\"1706\" data-end=\"1709\">\r\nEmail: <a data-start=\"1716\" data-end=\"1735\" class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\">khadija@example.com</a><br data-start=\"1735\" data-end=\"1738\">\r\nPhone: +880-171XXXXXXX</p>\r\n<p><br></p>',1,1,NULL,'2025-07-09 04:46:01','2025-07-09 04:46:01'),(54,'Meeting Request Email','<p data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"744\"><strong data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"744\">Dear xyz,</strong></p>\r\n<p>I hope this email finds you in good health.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"984\">We are excited to share a proposal regarding [brief description of the service/product]. Attached you’ll find the detailed document outlining our solution, scope, timeline, and cost estimation.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1143\">We believe this can add significant value to your operations. Please feel free to reach out if you have any questions or would like to schedule a discussion.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1145\" data-end=\"1184\">Thank you for considering our proposal.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1236\">Sincerely,<br data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1199\"><strong>xyz</strong><br data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1217\"><strong>Software Engineer</strong></p><p><br></p>',1,1,1,'2025-07-09 04:49:25','2025-07-09 05:48:44'),(55,'Proposal for Strategic Collaboration on crm','<p data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"433\"><strong data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"433\">Dear Mr./Ms. xyz,</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"470\">I hope this message finds you well.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"891\">My name is <strong data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"498\">[Your Name]</strong>, and I am writing to you on behalf of xyz, where we specialize in [brief description of your company’s service or expertise]. After reviewing your organization’s recent work and business goals, we believe there is an excellent opportunity for us to collaborate on a strategic level—particularly in the area of <strong>crm.</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"1155\">We would like to propose a structured engagement where our team would contribute [brief outline of what you’re offering], in alignment with your current needs and future plans. Our technical team has already analyzed key requirements and can offer the following:</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1157\" data-end=\"1160\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1197\"><strong data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1197\">Key Proposal Highlights:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1543\"><li data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1294\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1294\"><strong data-start=\"1200\" data-end=\"1218\">Scope of Work:</strong> Integration of [feature/service] into your existing [system or workflow].</p>\r\n</li><li data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1377\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1377\"><strong data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1310\">Timeline:</strong> Estimated completion within 4–6 weeks from the date of approval.</p>\r\n</li><li data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1465\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1465\"><strong data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1398\">Cost Estimate:</strong> BDT [amount] (including testing, deployment, and documentation).</p>\r\n</li><li data-start=\"1466\" data-end=\"1543\"><p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1543\"><strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1480\">Support:</strong> Post-deployment support and maintenance for 3 months included.</p><p data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1543\"><br></p>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1545\" data-end=\"1548\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1695\">We’re confident that this collaboration will help streamline your operations, reduce overhead, and add measurable value to your service delivery.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1697\" data-end=\"1884\">Please find the attached proposal document with full technical details, deliverables, pricing, and terms. We are happy to adjust the scope based on your feedback or specific requirements.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1886\" data-end=\"2095\">If you are available, we would appreciate the opportunity to present this to you in more detail during a short call or meeting. Please let us know a convenient time for you, and we will coordinate accordingly.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2097\" data-end=\"2234\">Thank you very much for your time and consideration. We look forward to the possibility of working together to deliver impactful results.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2236\" data-end=\"2408\">Warm regards,<br data-start=\"2249\" data-end=\"2252\"><strong>ABC</strong><br data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2297\"><strong>xyz Ltd</strong><br data-start=\"2320\" data-end=\"2323\">\r\nPhone: +880-1XXXXXXXXX<br data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2348\">\r\nEmail: <a data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2377\" class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\">your.email@example.com</a><br data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2380\">\r\nWebsite: <a data-start=\"2389\" data-end=\"2408\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"\" href=\"http://www.yourcompany.com\">www.yourcompany.com</a></p>\r\n<p><br></p>',1,1,NULL,'2025-07-09 04:53:01','2025-07-09 04:53:01');
